@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #8AB2E2
left to right direction
actor "Gestor autorizado
Administración del sistema" as Gestor
rectangle SIGAT {
usecase "CU01 Crear rol
[entrada UI pendiente]" as Crear #FFF4CF
usecase "CU02 Configurar rol" as Configurar
usecase "CU03 Editar familia de permisos" as Familia
usecase "CU04 Asignar / quitar rol a usuario" as Asignar
usecase "CU05 Eliminar rol
[entrada UI pendiente]" as Eliminar #FFF4CF
}
Gestor -- Crear
Gestor -- Configurar
Gestor -- Familia
Gestor -- Asignar
Gestor -- Eliminar
note bottom of Crear : Crear no obliga a configurar inmediatamente.
@enduml
